30,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It seems the same people have held the best spots for years without any review. Also, many complaints about bikes leaning.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I saw that people are shifting other bikes to get out, and some spots get quite wet in the rain.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,May,,"The building account is nearly empty for capital work, and the station park is expensive with a long waitlist.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,George,,"New racks require maintenance and effort. Also, the treasurer already spends hours on small cash collections.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Daily riders are actually willing to pay for a spot, but the neighbors had issues with people skipping meetings over fees.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, if people stop attending meetings, that's a serious problem for the community.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@George, if the racks are too hard to use, I worry for the older residents.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, if the treasurer is already busy, maybe we shouldn't add more billing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,George,,Exactly. Any system that adds paperwork will likely fail or burden one person.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Mio,,But the current system is unfair. The daily riders feel the imbalance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need a balance between fairness and maintaining our good relationships.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. We shouldn't let a few bike spots turn us against each other.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,May,,"If we can't afford new equipment, we have to work with what we have.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,George,,A simple system is a sustainable system.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, do you think a lottery would be better than paying?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"A lottery is fair, but it changes every year.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"It might prevent the ""shoving matches"" if people know it's temporary.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,May,,As long as it doesn't cost the building money we don't have.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,George,,A lottery is low maintenance compared to monthly billing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I think the daily riders would prefer something more stable, but fairness comes first.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
