55,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"The options are Paid Allocation, Shared Racks, or an Annual Lottery. I lean toward the lottery to avoid conflict.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Shared racks sound chaotic given the rain and the morning rush. I prefer the lottery.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,May,,"Paid allocation would help the building account, but George is right about the workload. I'll vote lottery.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,George,,Shared racks are too much physical work to maintain. Paid is too much paperwork. Lottery it is.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I wanted paid for the daily riders, but the neighbor's secretary's warning about arrears is scary. I'll go with lottery.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Misaki,,It seems we are all in agreement.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,It is the most peaceful way.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,May,,"I'll miss the extra funds, but peace is better.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,George,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Mio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
